    },
    {
      "en": "I think back to months ago when I first dreamt of having sex with my [niece].",
      "zh": "我回想起几个月前，我第一次梦见和 [niece] 做爱。"
    },
    {
      "en": "How many times have I had that dream since then?",
      "zh": "从那以后，那个梦我又做过多少次了？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "play sound \"static.mp3\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene happyroomsmile",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "with flash",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "stop sound",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "play music \"amiasleep.mp3\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’ve been through a lot together, haven’t we?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 我们一起经历过很多，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "It appears my teeth have grown back.",
      "zh": "看来我的牙齿又长回来了。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I open my mouth and answer the girl.",
      "zh": "我张开嘴，回答那个女孩。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’ve been through everything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我们什么都经历过了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sometimes I fear there is nothing left to experience.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 有时候我害怕，已经没有什么可以再经历的了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that so?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 是吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve only been here for [totaldays] days. Have you really done everything you came here to do?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 你在这里才待了 [totaldays] 天。你来这里要做的事，真的都做完了吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t really know. I’m not the programmer.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我也说不好。我又不是程序员。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Programmer?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 程序员？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": The one who put us here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 把我们放到这里的那个人。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah. You must be talking about God.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 啊。你说的肯定是上帝。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": But God is dead.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 可上帝死了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dead?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 死了？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can God die?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 上帝也会死吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think so.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我觉得会。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Doesn’t that defeat the purpose?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 那不就本末倒置了吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you seem more rational here than you do in the outside world?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 为什么你在这里，比在外面世界里更理智？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Outside world?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 外面的世界？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you think you exist in two worlds at once?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 你觉得自己同时存在于两个世界吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Two. Three. Maybe even more. Who knows?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 两个。三个。也许更多。谁知道呢？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re beginning to sound like her.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 你说话开始像她了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Her?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 她？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Me. ",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 我。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": The other me.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 另一个我。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": The better one.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 更好的那个。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m jealous.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我好羡慕。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 为什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want another version of myself with a cool hexadecimal name.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我也想要另一个自己，有一个酷酷的十六进制名字。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not all it’s cracked up to be.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 其实没那么好。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Here, I’ll let you try it out.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ": 来，我让你试试看。"
